  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Also given,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now finding,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
